# Layout primitives

Source of truth: `registry/new-york/ui/` and the docs site (`/`, `/stack`, …, `/agents`, `/llms.txt`).

Do not invent, rename, or synonymize primitives. Use these names exactly.

## Primitives

| Name | Component | Role |
|---|---|---|
| Stack | `<Stack>` | Vertical flex |
| Cluster | `<Cluster>` | Horizontal flex wrap |
| Aside | `<Aside>` + `Aside.Side` + `Aside.Content` | Complementary column + growing pane (not shadcn Sidebar) |
| Switcher | `<Switcher>` | Row that becomes a column at a container threshold |
| Grid | `<Grid>` | Auto-fit grid (`layout-grid`, not Tailwind `grid`) |
| Center | `<Center>` | Measure-constrained, centered |
| Cover | `<Cover>` + `Cover.Child` | Min-height column, child vertically centered |

## Props (only these)

- Cluster: `space`, `justify` (`start` \| `center` \| `end` \| `between`), `align`
- Stack: `space`, `as`
- Aside: `sideWidth`, `contentMin`, `space`, `side`
- Switcher: `threshold`, `space`, `limit`
- Grid: `min`, `space`
- Center: `measure`, `gutters`, `intrinsic`
- Cover: `minHeight`, `space`

## Recipes (only these)

- Form — Stack
- Page header — Cluster `justify="between"`
- Dialog actions — Cluster `justify="end"`
- Settings subnav — Aside

```tsx
// BAD
<div className="flex flex-col gap-4">…</div>
<div className="flex justify-between">…</div>

// GOOD
<Stack space="4">…</Stack>
<Cluster justify="between">…</Cluster>
```

If a layout is not in the table, it is not a primitive. Do not add a new name. Ask, or reuse an existing one.
